# Bug reports are emailed via Web3Forms (free).
# 1. Create a temporary or throwaway inbox (or use any Gmail).
# 2. Go to https://web3forms.com → Create Access Key → verify that email.
# 3. Paste the key below and restart the dev server.
#
# For GitHub Pages: set this same variable in your CI/deploy environment
# before `npm run build` so the key is baked into the production bundle.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
